

Aztec’s architecture consists of several interacting layers:

1. Aztec Contracts

Hybrid contracts containing both private and public functions.

2. Execution Layer

Handles encrypted computation and generates proofs.

3. Rollup Layer

Bundles transactions and submits proofs to Ethereum.

4. Settlement Layer

Ensures that private updates are valid and consistent on L1.

This layered approach offers:

Privacy by default

Lower fees compared to L1

Composability with Ethereum tools
